00:49:24,705 --> 00:49:30,705
Many Christmas stories have been adapted to feature films and TV specials,
and have been broadcast and repeated many times on television.

11
00:54:21,176 --> 00:54:27,176
Since the popularization of home video in the 1980s, these films are sold
and re-sold every year during the holiday shopping season.

12
00:59:17,647 --> 00:59:23,647
Many television networks, film studios, and production companies, such as cable television channels Hallmark and Lifetime, produce and
release new Christmas-themed films every year during or around December, all with variations of similar plots and themes.

13
01:04:14,117 --> 01:04:20,117
